T1  - Effects of electroacupuncture on myelin-related protein in corpus callosum of rats with focal cerebral ischemia
LA  - Chinese
KW  - protein Nogo
KW  - animal
KW  - brain ischemia
KW  - corpus callosum
KW  - electroacupuncture
