T1  - Electroacupuncture at Dong's Sanqixue combined with auricular point sticking in treatment of post-operative complications of complex anal fistula: a real world research
LA  - Chinese
KW  - acupuncture point
KW  - auricular acupuncture
KW  - electroacupuncture
