T1  - Effect of electroacupuncture combined with Schwann cell transplantation on limb locomotor ability, regional remyelination and expression of spinal CD4 and CD8 proteins in compressive spinal injury rats
LA  - Chinese
KW  - animal
KW  - CD8+ T lymphocyte
KW  - cell transplantation
